  "content": "<h2><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/bajosi/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CZ9fdGx.png\" width=\"1059\" height=\"103\"></a></h2><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/359/687/310/172/2021-04-28_20.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"655\" height=\"368\"></strong></h2><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>更好的原版調整</strong></h2><h4><em>• 隱形物品展示框&nbsp;</em>[<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bvt-invisible-item-frame\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a>]</h4><h4><em>• 黏性活塞側面&nbsp;</em>[<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bvt-sticky-piston-sides\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a>]*</h4><h4><em>• 不同莖幹&nbsp;</em>[<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bvt-different-stems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a>]*</h4><h4><em>• 更好的字型&nbsp;</em>[<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bvt-better-font\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a>]</h4><h4><em>• 圓形太陽與月亮&nbsp;</em>[<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bvt-circular-sun-and-moon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a>]*</h4><h4><strong><em>• <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">定向漏斗&nbsp;</span></em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">[<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bvt-directional-hoppers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a>]</span>*</strong></h4><h4><em>• 彩色附魔效果&nbsp;</em>[<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bvt-colorful-enchants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a>]*</h4><h4><em>• 彩色延遲指示器&nbsp;</em>[<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bvt-colorful-ping-indicator\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">連結</a>]*</h4><h4><em>•</em> <em>飢餓值預覽&nbsp;</em>[<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/bvt-hunger-p